        "body": "Dell Technologies is a for-profit public company founded in 1984 and headquartered in Round Rock, Texas, United States. It trades under the ticker DELL and has SEC CIK number 0001571996. The company's website describes it as providing technology solutions, services and support, with products that include laptops, touch screen PCs, desktops, servers, storage, monitors, gaming equipment and accessories.\n\nThe site highlights XPS 13 laptops and Dell 14 Plus, and describes Copilot+ PCs as combining powerful performance, built-in intelligence, and all-day battery life. Dell Premier is presented as a way for organizations to customize their IT experience, buy at the company's best online price, and streamline management. The site also mentions a 30-day return period calculated from invoice date, with exceptions.\n\nPublic records list 126 legal matters in Texas under the company's name. No individual cases are listed in the available data, and no products or MCP servers are listed.",
